<title>USA: F &amp; M National sets special cash div $0.05.</title>
<headline>F &amp; M National sets special cash div $0.05.</headline>
<dateline>WINCHESTER, Va. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>F&amp;M National Corp said on Thursday that it approved an extra cash dividend of $0.05 per share.</p>
<p>The additional cash dividend would be payable on January 22, 1997, to shareholders of record on December 27, 1996.</p>
<p>F&amp;M National which is based in Winchester, Virginia, has 11 bank affiliates with 96 locations serving communities in Virginia, West Virginia, and Maryland.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
